00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:05.438
<b>&gt;&gt; Hi.</b>

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.107
<b>I'm Ashley Feniello.</b>

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.675
<b>I'm an engineer in the Research </b>

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.443
<b>and AI Group.</b>

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.811
<b>We're working on a platform </b>

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.980
<b>that's for doing systems like </b>

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.247
<b>this.</b>

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.049
<b>This is one of the applications.</b>

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.318
<b>It's a mobile directions robot.</b>

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.986
<b>We have it in Building 99 </b>

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:21.988
<b>normally with a building map </b>

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.390
<b>there, and you can ask it to </b>

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.624
<b>take you to conference rooms, to</b>

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:25.625
<b>people's offices.</b>

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.227
<b>It can give people a tour.</b>

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.361
<b>It's built using this platform </b>

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.196
<b>called the Platform for Situated</b>

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:30.697
<b>Intelligence.</b>

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.332
<b>And lots of componentry that's </b>

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.933
<b>in place already for some of the</b>

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.969
