00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.638
<b>and there's a bridge to ROS for</b>

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:40.573
<b>using some of the low level </b>

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.244
<b>control components there.</b>

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.079
<b>The research interest is </b>

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.714
<b>essentially in adding more </b>

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.949
<b>social awareness to systems like</b>

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:50.250
