00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.852
<b>So things like understanding </b>

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.187
<b>multi-party engagement.</b>

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.622
<b>So, for example, our group of </b>

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:56.556
<b>people walks up to the robot, he</b>

