00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.095
<b>a good time to interrupt, things</b>

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:03.196
<b>like that.</b>

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:05.098
<b>Also classifying human </b>

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.066
<b>activities.  </b>

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.233
<b>So it can make decisions based </b>

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.301
<b>on that.  </b>

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.536
<b>And some more socially </b>

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:10.870
<b>appropriate navigation, like </b>

